{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t海關昨日在機場偵破一宗旅客販運毒品案件，檢獲約3公斤懷疑可卡因，估計市值約180萬元，拘捕一名男子。<br/>\n　　 <br/>\n海關表示，一名57歲印尼籍男旅客昨日從哥倫比亞波哥大經巴西聖保羅及卡塔爾多哈，飛抵本港。海關人員清關時，在他的寄艙行李箱的夾層中發現該批懷疑可卡因。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：鍾慧儀<br/>\n　　\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T13:45:55.866134+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":132,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T13:25:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T13:39:21.343072+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T13:39:21.343072+00:00","content_hash":"3c4e322c51e366ee9f99eb5416f7caf385139f8330b0a853acb90fbf2fe0dfae","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}